.TH batten-engine-pin 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-engine\-pin \- Set the config\*(Aqs engine pin, or refresh a declared source pin to this tree\*(Aqs digest
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten engine pin\fR [\fB\-\-check\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIvalue\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Set the config\*(Aqs engine pin, or refresh a declared source pin to this tree\*(Aqs digest
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-check\fR
Exit 1 when the pin would change, and write nothing
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIvalue\fR]
The pin to write: a release tag (v0.0.201), `source` for this tree\*(Aqs digest, or `version` for this engine\*(Aqs own release; omitted, refresh a declared source pin
